* SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
* mathieeedoubtrans.library (NDK mathieeedoubtrans_lib.fd), in the C900
* dialect of exec_lib.fd.  Each function takes MathIeeeDoubTransBase as
* its first argument.  Tieee and Fieee carry the single as its bits.
##base _MathIeeeDoubTransBase
##bias 30
##public
IEEEDPAtan(parm)(double) double @mtatan
IEEEDPSin(parm)(double) double @mtsin
IEEEDPCos(parm)(double) double @mtcos
IEEEDPTan(parm)(double) double @mttan
IEEEDPSincos(pf2,parm)(double *,double) double @mtsincos
IEEEDPSinh(parm)(double) double @mtsinh
IEEEDPCosh(parm)(double) double @mtcosh
IEEEDPTanh(parm)(double) double @mttanh
IEEEDPExp(parm)(double) double @mtexp
IEEEDPLog(parm)(double) double @mtlog
IEEEDPPow(exp,arg)(double,double) double @mtpow
IEEEDPSqrt(parm)(double) double @mtsqrt
IEEEDPTieee(parm)(double) LONG @mttieee
IEEEDPFieee(parm)(LONG) double @mtfieee
IEEEDPAsin(parm)(double) double @mtasin
IEEEDPAcos(parm)(double) double @mtacos
IEEEDPLog10(parm)(double) double @mtlog10
##end
